(RESERVE BANK OF INDIA) Tj
T*
(DEPARTMENT OF REGULATION, CENTRAL OFFICE, MUMBAI) Tj
T*
(RBI/2024-25/111 DOR.CRE.REC.66/21.07.001/2024-25) Tj
T*
(September 02, 2024) Tj
T*
(Guidelines on Digital Lending - Direct Disbursal, Cooling-off Period and Data Protection) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. All commercial banks, Primary Urban Co-operative Banks, and Non-Banking Financial Companies \(NBFCs\)) Tj
T*
(are directed to adhere to the comprehensive regulatory framework for digital lending operations.) Tj
T*
(2. Direct Disbursal Requirement: Regulated Entities \(REs\) shall ensure that all loan disbursals and repayments) Tj
T*
(are executed strictly directly between the bank account of the borrower and the Regulated Entity, without any) Tj
T*
(pass-through or pool account of any Lending Service Provider \(LSP\) or third party. Any deduction of fees or charges) Tj
T*
(shall be made directly by the RE from its own account.) Tj
T*
(3. Cooling-off and Look-up Period: A cooling-off or look-up period of not less than three calendar days shall be) Tj
T*
(provided to borrowers for digital loans having a tenor of seven days or more. For digital loans having a tenor of less) Tj
T*
(than seven days, the cooling-off period shall be not less than one calendar day. During this period, the borrower) Tj
T*
(may exit the digital loan without any penalty by paying the principal amount and the proportionate APR.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
9 0 obj
<< /Length 1087 >>
stream
BT
/F1 10 Tf
50 720 Td
13 TL
(4. Key Fact Statement \(KFS\): A standardized Key Fact Statement shall be provided to the borrower prior to the) Tj
T*
(execution of the loan contract. The KFS must disclose the Annual Percentage Rate \(APR\), recovery mechanisms, details of) Tj
T*
(the appointed Lending Service Provider, and the grievance redressal officer.) Tj
T*
(5. Storage of Borrower Data: LSPs and Digital Lending Apps \(DLAs\) shall not store any personal data of borrowers except) Tj
T*
(basic minimal identifiers such as name, address, and verified contact details required for loan servicing. Biometric data) Tj
T*
(shall never be stored under any circumstances. Access to mobile phone resources such as file storage, contact lists, and) Tj
T*
(call logs is strictly prohibited.) Tj
T*
(6. Reporting to Credit Information Companies \(CICs\): REs must report all digital lending transactions, including delinquencies) Tj
T*
(and restructured facilities, to all four licensed Credit Information Companies on a monthly basis, irrespective of loan amount) Tj
T*
(or tenor.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
10 0 obj
<< /Length 916 >>
stream
BT
/F1 10 Tf
50 720 Td
13 TL
(7. Grievance Redressal Mechanism: Regulated Entities shall appoint a dedicated Nodal Grievance Redressal Officer) Tj
T*
(to deal with complaints against digital lending apps and LSPs. The contact details of the Nodal Officer must be prominently) Tj
T*
(displayed on the website of the RE and the DLA. Complaints must be resolved within a maximum period of 30 calendar days.) Tj
T*
(8. Escalation to Ombudsman: If a grievance lodged by a borrower is not resolved within 30 days or is rejected by the RE,) Tj
T*
(the borrower may escalate the complaint to the Reserve Bank - Integrated Ombudsman Scheme \(RB-IOS\).) Tj
T*
(9. Annual Audit of Digital Lending Systems: Regulated Entities shall ensure that Digital Lending Apps and LSPs undergo an annual) Tj
T*
(cybersecurity audit by CERT-In empanelled auditors confirming compliance with data localization and security controls.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
11 0 obj
<< /Length 867 >>
stream
BT
/F1 10 Tf
50 720 Td
13 TL
(10. First Loss Default Guarantee \(FLDG\) Norms: Contractual arrangements between Regulated Entities and LSPs involving) Tj
T*
(Default Loss Guarantee \(DLG\) shall not exceed five percent \(5 percent\) of the total outstanding loan portfolio underwritten through) Tj
T*
(the concerned LSP.) Tj
T*
(11. Form of DLG: Regulated Entities shall accept DLG only in the form of cash deposit, fixed deposits maintained with scheduled) Tj
T*
(commercial banks with lien marked in favor of the RE, or bank guarantee in favor of the RE.) Tj
T*
(12. Monitoring of DLG Arrangements: Every RE entering into DLG arrangements shall put in place a Board-approved policy and conduct) Tj
T*
(an eligibility assessment of the DLG provider at least on an annual basis.) Tj
T*
(Yours faithfully,) Tj
T*
(\(R. Lakshmi\)) Tj
T*
(Chief General Manager) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
